09-22T16:55:08.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"🎉 Alright, Grand Junction/Fruita/Palisade, and surrounding areas 💙\n\nOur friends at @[100092453476692:2048:Chicken -N- The Bag] Food Truck, a locally owned and operated small business, has been nominated for the Colorado Restaurant Association’s 2026 HOSPYS Awards! 🏆🍗\n\nThe HOSPYS celebrate the incredible talent, dedication, and accomplishments of Colorado’s restaurant and hospitality community and we couldn’t be more excited to see a local Grand Junction favorite recognized! 🙌\n\nSo, Grand Junction, Fruita, Palisade, and surrounding areas, let’s do what we do best: SUPPORT LOCAL! 💪\n\n👉 Take a few moments to cast your vote:\n1️⃣ Click the link\n2️⃣ Select VOTE\n3️⃣ Scroll down to the Food Truck category\n4️⃣ Vote for Chicken N The Bag! 🍗🔥\n\nAnd while you’re there, be sure to show some love to any other Colorado restaurants, food trucks, or hospitality businesses you’ve had a great experience with! ❤️\n\nLet’s show Colorado what happens when Grand Junction comes together, supports our local businesses, and cheers on our own!\n\nLet’s get Chicken -N- The Bag that HOSPYS recognition! 🏆🍗🎉\n\nhttps://cohospyawards.com/vote/","creation_time":1790095913,"id":4474746889465754,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/3741333852807065/permalink/4474746889465754/","react_count":0,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-22T10:51:53.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-22T16:51:53.000Z"}},{"comment_count":0,"content":"","creation_time":1790094018,"id":4474718746135235,"post_url":"https://facebook.com/groups/3741333852807065/permalink/4474718746135235/","react_count":4,"source_record_created_at":{"user_local":"2026-09-22T10:20:18.000-06:00","user_timezone":"America/Denver","utc":"2026-09-22T16:20:18.000Z"}},{"comment_count":11,"content":"Just happened to be driving by when they dropped the Dino. FMHS class of 2010 gets to make a brief comeback before they put the new mural up. Having that cove